## 1. Strategic Direction

We are **not building pages**. We are building **Ndukego OS** — a business operating system for Ndukego Investments & Properties.

```
                    NDUKEGO OS
                ┌──────────────────┐
                │  Public Website  │  ← Phase 5 (last)
                └────────┬─────────┘
                         │
                ┌────────▼─────────┐
                │      API         │  ← Phase 3
                └────────┬─────────┘
                         │
    ┌────────────────────┼────────────────────┐
    │                    │                    │
┌───▼────┐         ┌─────▼─────┐       ┌──────▼─────┐
│ Admin  │         │ Mobile App│       │ AI Platform│
│ Portal │         │  (future) │       │            │
└────────┘         └───────────┘       └────────────┘
                         │
                ┌────────▼─────────┐
                │  PostgreSQL DB   │  ← Phase 2 (NOW)
                └──────────────────┘
```

**Key principle:** The website is just a client. The business logic lives in the database and API. Staff run daily operations through the Admin Portal first.

**No simulated data policy:** All features read from and write to PostgreSQL. No mock arrays, no hardcoded listings, no fake customers. System bootstrap seeds only roles, permissions, and optional super-admin from environment variables.

