## 3. Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|-------|-----------|-----------|
| Monorepo | Turborepo + pnpm | Shared packages, parallel builds |
| Database | PostgreSQL 16+ | Enterprise relational integrity |
| ORM | Prisma 6 | Type-safe schema, migrations |
| Backend | NestJS 11 | Modular enterprise architecture |
| Validation | Zod (shared) + class-validator (API) | Shared schemas across apps |
| Auth | JWT + Refresh Tokens + MFA (admin) | Industry standard |
| Authorization | RBAC (ABAC-ready) | Matches domain permission specs |
| Document Storage | Abstracted (local dev / S3 prod) | Rule 12.14 — not tied to one provider |
| Admin UI | Next.js 16 + Tailwind 4 | Internal operations portal |
| Public Web | Next.js 16 | API client only |
| Audit | Immutable append-only log table | Rule 8 — nothing deleted |

