## 4. Monorepo Structure

```
Ndukego Homes Gallery Project/
├── Discuss.readme              ← YOU ARE HERE (living spec)
├── apps/
│   ├── api/                    ← NestJS backend (port 4000)
│   ├── admin/                  ← Internal admin portal (port 3001)
│   └── web/                    ← Public website (port 3000)
├── packages/
│   ├── database/               ← @nhgp/database (Prisma)
│   ├── types/                  ← @nhgp/types (shared TS types)
│   ├── validation/             ← @nhgp/validation (Zod schemas)
│   ├── config/                 ← @nhgp/config (env validation)
│   ├── lib/                    ← @nhgp/lib (shared utilities)
│   ├── utils/                  ← @nhgp/utils
│   ├── hooks/                  ← @nhgp/hooks (React hooks)
│   └── ui/                     ← @repo/ui (shared components)
```

