## 5. Implementation Phases

### Phase 1 — Business Foundation ✅ (Spec complete for 11 domains)
Document remaining 7 domains in this file, then freeze.

### Phase 2 — Database 🔄 CURRENT
- Prisma schema for all 18 domains
- Enums, relationships, indexes, constraints
- Migration files
- System bootstrap seed (roles/permissions only)

### Phase 3 — Backend
Week-by-week module order:
1. Auth + Employee + Roles
2. Property + Estate + Development + Building
3. Customer
4. Reservation
5. Sale + Payment
6. Inspection + Documents
7. Vendor + Appointment + Notification
8. AI Platform + Audit Log
9. Dashboard aggregations

### Phase 4 — Admin Portal
Dashboard → Properties → Customers → Sales → Reservations → Payments → Employees → Documents → Reports → Settings → Notifications → AI Assistant

### Phase 5 — Public Website
Properties, search, customer login, reservations, appointments, AI assistant — all via API.

