## 6. Session Log

### Session 1 — 2026-07-22

**Goal:** Begin Phase 2 & 3 — Database schema + NestJS foundation

**Decisions made:**
- Package scope renamed to `@nhgp/*` for NHGP branding
- PostgreSQL as sole data store — zero mock data in application code
- Prisma multi-file schema in `packages/database/prisma/schema/`
- Soft delete pattern (`deletedAt`) on all business entities
- UUID primary keys on all entities
- Audit log as separate immutable table, triggered by service layer
- Document storage abstracted via `StorageProvider` interface
- Payments are **record-only** — staff records after physical/bank verification
- Super admin bootstrapped from `SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL` + `SUPER_ADMIN_PASSWORD` env vars on first seed

**Work started:**
- [x] Discuss.readme created
- [ ] Prisma schema (18 domains)
- [ ] Shared packages configured
- [ ] NestJS API modules
- [ ] Environment templates

