## 7. Domain Specifications (Remaining 7)

### Domain 13 — Employee & Human Resource Management

**Business Definition:** Every person who works for or with Ndukego — employees, contractors with system access, and organizational structure.

**Core Attributes:**
- Employee ID (UUID), Employee Number, Staff Code
- Personal: First Name, Last Name, Middle Name, Date of Birth, Gender, Nationality
- Contact: Email, Phone, WhatsApp, Address, Emergency Contact
- Employment: Department, Job Title, Job Level, Employment Type (Full-time, Part-time, Contract, Intern)
- Status: Active, On Leave, Suspended, Terminated, Resigned
- Dates: Hire Date, Confirmation Date, Termination Date
- Identity: National ID, Passport, BVN (where permitted)
- Banking: Bank Name, Account Number (encrypted)
- Manager: Reports To (self-referencing)
- Permissions: Linked to Role(s)

**Business Rules:**
- Every system user must link to an Employee or Customer record
- Terminated employees lose access immediately
- HR documents stored in Document Vault under Employee entity
- Only HR and Executives can view full employee records

---

### Domain 14 — Roles & Permission Management (RBAC)

**Business Definition:** Controls who can do what across the entire platform.

**Predefined Roles (MVP):**
| Role | Code | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Super Administrator | `SUPER_ADMIN` | Full system access |
| Executive | `EXECUTIVE` | Approve, archive, analytics, override |
| Sales Staff | `SALES_STAFF` | Create properties, manage customers, sales |
| Inspector | `INSPECTOR` | Upload inspection reports |
| Legal Officer | `LEGAL_OFFICER` | Verify titles, approve legal documents |
| Marketing Team | `MARKETING` | Publish ads, SEO, featured listings |
| Finance | `FINANCE` | Valuations, payments, invoices |
| Property Manager | `PROPERTY_MANAGER` | Manage estates, properties, maintenance docs |
| HR Manager | `HR_MANAGER` | Employee records, onboarding |
| Customer | `CUSTOMER` | View published properties, reserve, inspect |
| System | `SYSTEM` | Automated processes, AI, cron jobs |

**Permission Model:**
- Permission = `{resource}.{action}` e.g. `property.publish`, `document.approve`
- Roles have many Permissions
- Employees have many Roles
- Guards enforce at controller + service level

---

### Domain 15 — Vendor & Contractor Management

**Core Attributes:** Vendor ID, Company Name, Contact Person, Category (Construction, Legal, Survey, Marketing, IT, Security), Status, Contract Start/End, Rating, Documents

**Relationships:** Vendor → Documents, Vendor → Projects, Vendor → Payments

---

### Domain 16 — Appointment Management

**Types:** Property Inspection, Office Visit, Document Signing, Payment Meeting, General Consultation

**Attributes:** Appointment ID, Type, Customer, Property (optional), Employee (assigned), Date/Time, Duration, Status (Scheduled, Confirmed, Completed, Cancelled, No-Show), Location, Notes, Reminder Sent

---

### Domain 17 — Notification System

**Channels:** In-App, Email, SMS (future), Push (future)

**Triggers:** Document events, Payment events, Reservation events, Appointment reminders, Property status changes, System alerts

**Attributes:** Notification ID, Recipient, Channel, Type, Title, Body, Read Status, Entity Reference, Created At

---

### Domain 18 — AI Platform

**Architecture:** One AI brain, multiple modes (Customer, Sales, Property, Document, Executive, Internal)

**MVP Components:**
- `AiConversation` — session with mode + user context
- `AiMessage` — individual messages
- `AiKnowledgeEntry` — indexed business data the AI can reference (permission-scoped)
- Integration point for OpenAI/Anthropic (configured via env, not hardcoded)

**Rules:**
- AI never exposes data beyond user's permission scope
- AI responses cite verified platform data only
- All AI interactions logged in audit trail

---

### Domain 19 — Audit Log (Platform Domain)

**Immutable record of every sensitive action.**

**Fields:** Audit ID, Actor (User/Employee), Action, Entity Type, Entity ID, Old Values (JSON), New Values (JSON), IP Address, User Agent, Timestamp

**Rules:**
- Audit logs cannot be modified or deleted
- Every CRUD on sensitive entities generates an audit entry
- Document downloads/previews logged here too

---

## 8. Business Rules Registry

Non-negotiable rules enforced in service layer + database constraints:

| Rule | Domain | Enforcement |
|------|--------|-------------|
| Property cannot be Published without inspection + legal verification + photos + docs + management approval | Property | `PropertyPublishGuard` service |
| Sold property cannot return to Available | Property | Status transition validator |
| Only Management can archive | Property | RBAC guard |
| Only verified employees approve listings | Property | RBAC + employee.verified flag |
| Every property belongs to Estate or Development | Property | DB foreign key constraint |
| Every property has at least one inspection | Property | Publish guard check |
| Every legal document is versioned | Document | Version chain on update |
| Every change is audited | All | AuditInterceptor |
| No orphan documents | Document | Required entityType + entityId |
| Documents never overwritten | Document | New version on update |
| Every download/preview logged | Document | Audit + DocumentAccessLog |
| Soft delete only | All | `deletedAt` pattern |
| Payments recorded by staff only | Payment | No customer payment initiation endpoint |

---

## 9. Security Architecture

- JWT access tokens (15 min) + refresh tokens (7 days, rotated)
- MFA required for Super Admin and Executive roles
- bcrypt password hashing (cost factor 12)
- Rate limiting on auth endpoints
- CORS restricted to known origins
- Helmet security headers
- Input validation on every endpoint (Zod + class-validator)
- SQL injection prevented by Prisma parameterized queries
- Document encryption at rest (AES-256)
- Sensitive PII fields encrypted in database
- Secrets via environment variables only

---

## 10. Payment Strategy (MVP)

**No online property payments.**

- All transactions occur physically at office or via approved business banking
- Staff records payments after verification
- Customers view payment history, balances, receipts, installment schedules via portal
- Payment statuses: Pending Verification, Verified, Rejected, Refunded
- Links to Sale, Reservation, Customer, Property

---

## 11. AI Strategy (MVP)

Single AI platform with mode switching:

| Mode | Context | Permissions |
|------|---------|-------------|
| Customer Assistant | Public property data | Customer role scope |
| Sales Assistant | CRM + properties | Sales staff scope |
| Property Assistant | Full property details | Property manager scope |
| Document Assistant | Document vault | Document permissions |
| Executive Assistant | Analytics + all data | Executive scope |
| Internal Staff Assistant | General operations | Employee role scope |

Provider configured via `AI_PROVIDER` and `AI_API_KEY` environment variables.

